  "description": "Make your designs pop with this vibrant neon diagonal stripe seamless pattern in vivid pink, yellow, blue, and green. Featuring an energetic mix of brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green, this bold striped design brings movement and a lively modern feel to any creative project. The repeating diagonal lines are ideal for colorful backgrounds, trendy packaging, digital paper, and eye-catching prints. Use this electric color palette to create playful summer graphics, retro-inspired artwork, and standout DIY crafts.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Fabric prints and textile designs\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects\n• Party invitations and decorations\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts\n• Social media graphics and digital collages\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects",
